<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="nl">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>AIzichtbaar — Word geciteerd door ChatGPT & AI</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <style>
        :root { --green: #1E6B3A; --green-dark: #14532D; }
        .btn-primary { background: var(--green); }
        .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--green-dark); }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-50 text-gray-900">
    <header class="bg-white shadow-sm">
        <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-4 flex items-center justify-between">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <img src="/images/logo.svg" alt="AIzichtbaar" class="h-10">
                <span class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#1E6B3A]">AIzichtbaar</span>
            </div>
            <div class="space-x-4">
                <a href="#" class="text-[#1E6B3A] font-medium">Inloggen</a>
                <a href="#" class="btn-primary text-white px-5 py-2 rounded-lg font-medium">Gratis starten</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main>
        <section class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-20 text-center">
            <h1 class="text-5xl font-bold mb-6 leading-tight">
                Geef je website door.<br>
                <span class="text-[#1E6B3A]">Wij maken je citeerbaar in AI.</span>
            </h1>
            <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
                Geen technische kennis nodig. Stuur je URL, de AI doet de rest: analyse, citation-ready content en zichtbaarheid in ChatGPT, Perplexity en Google AI.
            </p>
            <form class="max-w-md mx-auto flex gap-2" action="#" method="post">
                <input type="url" placeholder="https://jouwwebsite.nl" required
                       class="flex-1 px-4 py-3 rounded-lg border border-gray-300 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#1E6B3A]">
                <button type="submit" class="btn-primary text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold">
                    Start nu
                </button>
            </form>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-4">Gratis check • Geen creditcard • Resultaat binnen minuten</p>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-white py-16">
            <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 text-center">
                <div>
                    <div class="text-4xl mb-3">🔗</div>
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2">Alleen je URL</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-600">Geen formulieren van 20 vragen. Alleen je website.</p>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <div class="text-4xl mb-3">✨</div>
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2">AI doet de rest</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-600">Analyse, content en optimalisatie voor AI-platformen.</p>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <div class="text-4xl mb-3">📈</div>
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2">Bijna te goed</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-600">Beter ranken én geciteerd worden door ChatGPT.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="bg-[#1E6B3A] text-white py-8 text-center">
        <p>© {{ "now"|date("Y") }} AIzichtbaar — Maak je zichtbaar in AI.</p>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
